		{"id":"41426b008fa3c9c3","type":"file","file":"_Attachments/Images/Capture_20260508_020247.jpg","x":-1100,"y":2357,"width":400,"height":217},
		{"id":"33d978aa056b3bf0","type":"file","file":"_Attachments/Images/Capture_20260507_165833.jpg","x":-2235,"y":1720,"width":567,"height":166},
		{"id":"06759ab0bf0546de","type":"file","file":"_Attachments/Images/Capture_20260507_170007.jpg","x":-2347,"y":2040,"width":800,"height":116},
		{
			"id":"86d1b0c949a02691",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"1. $r(A) \\neq r([A, b])$ $\\Longleftrightarrow$ $r(A) + 1 = r([A, b])$，即系数矩阵的秩不等于增广矩阵的值，那么只能比增广矩阵少 $1$.\n2. 若 $r(A) = r([A, b]) = r < n$，则等价于**有效方程数量小于未知数的数量**，约束太少，有无穷多解",
			"styleAttributes":{"textAlign":"center"},
			"x":-1840,
			"y":2369,
			"width":560,
			"height":193
		},
		{
			"id":"22c5156d866e87db",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"⭐非齐通 = 齐通 + 非奇特",
			"styleAttributes":{"textAlign":"center"},
			"x":-2515,
			"y":2991,
			"width":350,
			"height":113
		},
		{"id":"49e3c159bd5648a2","type":"file","file":"_Attachments/Images/Pasted image 20260506204823.png","x":-2640,"y":2387,"width":600,"height":157},
		{"id":"f79e47168b913354","type":"file","file":"_Attachments/Images/pintu-fulicat.com-1778071607290.png","x":-3460,"y":2387,"width":625,"height":660},
		{"id":"9431d3cf9a83a342","type":"file","file":"_Attachments/Images/Pasted image 20260506204855.png","x":-2640,"y":2666,"width":599,"height":228},
		{"id":"67dec7158f1e2167","type":"file","file":"_Attachments/Images/Pasted image 20260506204344.png","x":-4260,"y":2856,"width":624,"height":193},
		{"id":"bac40b9487c8132d","type":"file","file":"_Attachments/Images/Pasted image 20260506204837.png","x":-2640,"y":2547,"width":599,"height":118},
		{"id":"e112fa267b5054d7","type":"file","file":"_Attachments/Images/Pasted image 20260506204316.png","x":-4260,"y":2599,"width":615,"height":257},
		{
			"id":"f7560f31e0928934",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"齐次方程组由于增广系数都是 $0$，所以不可能得到“系数矩阵的秩不等于增广矩阵的秩”的结果，即**齐次方程组一定有解**（且全 $0$ 一定是一组解）",
			"styleAttributes":{"textAlign":"center"},
			"x":-4218,
			"y":3600,
			"width":542,
			"height":220
		},
		{"id":"6a95971604397580","type":"file","file":"_Attachments/Images/Pasted image 20260506204403.png","x":-4260,"y":3052,"width":625,"height":344},
		{"id":"882ddac549513322","type":"file","file":"_Attachments/Images/Pasted image 20260506204301.png","x":-4260,"y":2430,"width":625,"height":166},
		{"id":"a07951d52fd438f4","type":"file","file":"_Attachments/Images/Pasted image 20260506204231.png","x":-4960,"y":2430,"width":599,"height":507},
		{
			"id":"d1f01848700605db",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"(1) 齐次线性方程组（非齐次的导出组）",
			"styleAttributes":{"textAlign":"center"},
			"x":-4400,
			"y":2070,
			"width":430,
			"height":60
		},
		{
			"id":"6fb146295ee32ae4",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"(2) 解方程原理与高斯消元法及解的判定",
			"styleAttributes":{"textAlign":"center"},
			"x":-3338,
			"y":1262,
			"width":438,
			"height":118
		},
		{
			"id":"2daf9369d58c3dc3",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"(2) 非齐次线性方程组",
			"styleAttributes":{"textAlign":"center"},
			"x":-3080,
			"y":2030,
			"width":320,
			"height":80
		},
		{"id":"93327d25423172f6","type":"file","file":"_Attachments/Images/pintu-fulicat.com-1778072309785.png","x":-7760,"y":954,"width":727,"height":944},
		{"id":"710f0d1a06722122","type":"file","file":"_Attachments/Images/Capture_20260507_165508.jpg","x":-6878,"y":1655,"width":927,"height":92},
		{
			"id":"8948a375a86446fd",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"(1) 线性方程组的定义与概念",
			"styleAttributes":{"textAlign":"center"},
			"x":-7126,
			"y":485,
			"width":420,
			"height":130
		},
		{"id":"42782bcd080ad1cf","type":"file","file":"_Attachments/Images/Capture_20260507_164600.jpg","x":-6840,"y":1070,"width":841,"height":411},
		{
			"id":"48ef7ad740a5f172",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"求线性方程组的通解",
			"styleAttributes":{"textAlign":"center"},
			"x":4320,
			"y":3211,
			"width":320,
			"height":100
		},
		{
			"id":"9ca07956c5624afc",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"1. 化成行最简阶梯矩阵后，主元列对应的变量是基本变量，其余变量是自由变量，对所有自由变量赋值 $k_1, k_2, \\cdots$，然后反解出基本变量即可\n2. 快速反解出基本变量的取值：该行一定只剩自由变量，**把所有自由变量的系数取反 + 增广系数的值**即可",
			"styleAttributes":{"textAlign":"center"},
			"x":4880,
			"y":3191,
			"width":540,
			"height":200
		},
		{"id":"1a0ef4346c1c7b01","type":"file","file":"_Attachments/Images/Pasted image 20260513125923.png","x":5000,"y":3540,"width":399,"height":250},
		{
			"id":"6a64714d6de40cb7",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"极大无关组的向量个数\n和基础解系的向量个数",
			"styleAttributes":{"textAlign":"center"},
			"x":4300,
			"y":3580,
			"width":280,
			"height":125
		},
		{"id":"00a44c226bf20d9b","type":"file","file":"_Attachments/Images/Pasted image 20260513133525.png","x":4934,"y":7206,"width":522,"height":234},
		{
			"id":"3e80c39f6c3d5dee",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"矩阵方程转化为线性方程组是否有解",
			"styleAttributes":{"textAlign":"center"},
			"x":4358,
			"y":6720,
			"width":420,
			"height":152
		},
		{
			"id":"0aa6440a50a2e653",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"抽象向量组求基础解系和通解",
			"styleAttributes":{"textAlign":"center"},
			"x":4260,
			"y":6264,
			"width":360,
			"height":117
		},
		{
			"id":"dd4d18bb51509514",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"齐次和非齐次的线性无关的解的最多数量",
			"styleAttributes":{"textAlign":"center"},
			"x":4260,
			"y":7300,
			"width":418,
			"height":140
		},
		{
			"id":"e04f87792170f0f4",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"非齐次线性方程组求解基础解系和通解",
			"styleAttributes":{"textAlign":"center"},
			"x":4240,
			"y":5679,
			"width":380,
			"height":134
		},
		{
			"id":"a1965f4d2a64ebad",
